--- | --- |\n| Small | $6$ | $7$ | $9$ | $8$ | $30$ |\n| Large | $5$ | $1$ | $7$ | $7$ | $20$ |\n| Totals | $11$ | $8$ | $16$ | $15$ | $50$ |\n\nEstimate the probability that a randomly selected sold drink is a small Fanta."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234073 :question/math-academy-id "q-47299" :question/problem "Rose surveyed $168$ children in Arizona High School. She asked them about their favorite topics in math, between geometry and algebra. Her findings are summarized in the two-way frequency table below. \n\n|  | Geometry | Algebra | Totals |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Girls | $28$ | $63$ | $91$ |\n| Boys | $56$ | $21$ | $77$ |\n| Totals | $84$ | $84$ | $168$ |\n\nLet $B$ be the event that a randomly selected child is a **\"Boy\"** and $G$ the event that a randomly selected child likes **\"Geometry\"**. Estimate $P(B\\cap G).$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Estimating the Probability of the Intersection of Events" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049705 :topic/math-academy-id 131 :topic/title "Compound Events in Probability From Experimental Data"}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054663 :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055329 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "70" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053212} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "40" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053213} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053214} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "30" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053215} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "80" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053216}] :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186053211}] :question/math-academy-id "q-47138" :question/problem "A group of randomly selected students from School A was asked about whether or not they use TV or the internet to acces